# The Deploy to Cloudflare button turns every uncommented line in this file into
# a required field on its form. These lines are commented out on purpose: the
# keys are build variables, which TinaCloud (or you, see the README) add after
# the deploy, so the form should not ask for them.
# For local development, copy .env.example to .env instead.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TINA_CLIENT_ID=
# TINA_TOKEN=
